{"resourceIdentifier":"5281","resourceName":"Suide County Urban MSW Landfill Biogas Pollution Control and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Suide County Urban MSW Landfill Biogas Pollution Control and Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located at Suide County MSW landfill site , Shenjiawan Village, Mingzhou Town, Suide County, Yulin City, Shaanxi Province, P.R. China. The project is constructed and operated by Suide County BCCY New Power CO., Ltd. \r\nThe project started to construct on 30-Sep-2022.The project has a total designed capacity 1MW (2*0.5MW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the Northwest China Power Grid (NCPG). Total electricity supplied to the grid in the crediting period from 24-Feb-2023 to 23-Feb-2033 will be 57,844MWh. VCUs will be claimed from the methane destroyed and the grid electricity displaced. The estimated annual average GHG emission reductions of the project is 35,258tCO2e and the total GHG emission reductions and removals are 352,588tCO2e during the fixed 10 years crediting period from 24-Feb-2023 to 23-Feb-2033.","location":{"latitude":37.468420,"longitude":110.261606},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-10-09","endExclusive":"2024-11-09","endInclusive":"2024-11-08"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5281"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Shaanxi Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"35258"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-I.D.,AMS-III.G."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"06/11/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 24/02/2023 - 23/02/2033"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=120144&IDKEY=80e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9j165678576","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PD_PCP_5281_09OCT2024.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-10-09T19:42:22.953Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=119338&IDKEY=oiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf5164567102","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Suide-Listing-Representation-Single-PP-v4.2.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-09-24T01:41:25.483Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=140622&IDKEY=fiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf9193917738","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"PD_VCS 5281_v3.0_CL.pdf","uploadDate":"2025-11-06T19:01:33.43Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=123791&IDKEY=aq934lkmsad39asjdkfj90qlkalsdkngaf98ulkandDfdvDdfhk170707789","documentType":"Registration Representation","documentName":"Registration-Representation-Single-PP-v4.4-Suide.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-12-02T04:50:39.357Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=140623&IDKEY=2iofj09234rm9